.claude/
build/
# No Python entries here on purpose (NATIVE_PLAN.md N11). __pycache__/,
# *.pyc, .pytest_cache/, *.egg-info/ and dist/ used to be listed; ignoring
# them now would quietly hide the exact thing CI checks for, which is that
# this repository contains no `.py` file at all.
*.funnyc
*.funnypak
# The bootstrap bundles are *not* checked in any more: since NATIVE_PLAN.md
# N10 task 1 the toolchain is compiled into the binary as native/
# toolchain_blob.c, which is the checked-in generated artifact instead (and
# is a .c file, so nothing here excludes it). These are intermediates on the
# way to regenerating it -- see bootstrap/STAGE0.md.
*.exe

# native/ build output (build.sh / build.bat -- NATIVE_PLAN.md N0/N7):
# the CLI, and the runtime stub `funny yeet` appends programs to.
/funny
/funnyrt
*.obj
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.o
